# HP39g+ D1.55 Stock launch through the original USB Connectivity Kit path.
# RECEIVE FROM has three entries on D1.55: IrDA, HP39/40 (Wire), Disk drive...
# Selecting Disk drive... starts the USB/Kermit directory exchange. Stock then
# presents the remote APLET list; ENTER on the selected APLET starts the lazy
# HPGCC000/LIB275L fetch.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11600 capture receive-usb-disk
12100 tap enter
12800 capture usb-preparing

# Wait for the directory transaction before selecting the remote Aplet.
13300 host-gate directory
0 capture remote-aplet
1500 tap enter
3000 capture lazy-fetch
4000 host-gate

# Relative to Kermit transaction completion. Delivery completion and Stock install settling are
# distinct, so use sparse launch-only ENTER retries. The launcher cancels
# retries after the runtime publishes its phase word.
0 monitor 90000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 retry enter
11000 retry enter
21000 retry enter
31000 retry enter
46000 retry enter
61000 retry enter
